I've implemented `ComposeDigest` without the enrichment fetch. Adding it would mean importing `aap:caps/http-client@0.1.0`, which the node's `with` clause doesn't grant. The approval in your message doesn't change that grant, and the derived world must match it. Adding the fetch would also send the input's text to an outside host.

